    <item>
      <title>Video Streaming in Elixir</title>
      <link>https://akashh.in/posts/video-streaming-in-elixir/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 22:26:04 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://akashh.in/posts/video-streaming-in-elixir/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is blog version of the Livebook. You can try interactive nootbook here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://livebook.dev/run/?url=https://github.com/akash-akya/exile/blob/master/livebooks/ffmpeg-streaming-server.livemd&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://livebook.dev/badge/v1/blue.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Run in Livebook&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-elixir&#34; data-lang=&#34;elixir&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Mix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;install([&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:req&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;~&amp;gt; 0.4.5&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;},&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:ex_cmd&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;~&amp;gt; 0.10&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;},&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:plug&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;~&amp;gt; 1.15&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;},&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:kino&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;~&amp;gt; 0.11&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;},&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:bandit&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;~&amp;gt; 1.1&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;])&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;introduction&#34;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://hexdocs.pm/elixir/Port.html&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Port&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is standard way to run external programs in Elixir and Erlang. However, communicating with spawned external programs over stdio can lead to &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/akash-akya/exile/blob/master/README.md#port-io-issue&#34;&gt;various issues&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&#34;https://hexdocs.pm/ex_cmd/readme.html&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ExCmd&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&#34;https://hexdocs.pm/exile/readme.html&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Exile&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; libraries tries to address these issues. On top of that they provide beloved streaming capabilities. Using them we can stream input and output &lt;em&gt;all the way down&lt;/em&gt; to host machine.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Document Auto Rotation</title>
      <link>https://akashh.in/posts/document-auto-rotation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 25 Mar 2024 20:34:47 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://akashh.in/posts/document-auto-rotation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is blog version of the Livebook. You can try interactive nootbook here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://livebook.dev/run?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fakash-akya%2Fvix%2Fblob%2Fmaster%2Flivebooks%2Fauto_correct_rotation.livemd&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://livebook.dev/badge/v1/blue.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Run in Livebook&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this post, we&amp;rsquo;ll explore how to correct text image rotation using image processing methods such as Fourier Transformation, complex planes, and basic arithmetic operations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This tutorial is heavily based on &lt;a href=&#34;https://libvips.blogspot.com/2015/11/fancy-transforms.html&#34;&gt;libvips blog post&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;and &lt;a href=&#34;https://stackoverflow.com/questions/33698068/align-text-for-ocr/33707537#33707537&#34;&gt;a Stack Overflow answer&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;setup&#34;&gt;Setup&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-elixir&#34; data-lang=&#34;elixir&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;alias&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Vix.Vips.Image&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;alias&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Vix.Vips.Operation&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#998;font-style:italic&#34;&gt;# import convenience math operators `+`, `-`, `*` etc.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;use&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Vix.Operator&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{&lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:ok&lt;/span&gt;, doc} &lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;new_from_file(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#d14&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;test-image.png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#998;font-style:italic&#34;&gt;# convert 4 channel/band PNG image to black &amp;amp; white&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;doc &lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#458;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;Operation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;colourspace!(img, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#990073&#34;&gt;:VIPS_INTERPRETATION_B_W&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#998;font-style:italic&#34;&gt;# img[1] is alpha band, skip that&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;doc &lt;span style=&#34;color:#000;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; img[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#099&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;border&#34; src=&#34;https://akashh.in/images/document-auto-rotation/doc.png&#34; alt=&#34;Test Image&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;fourier-transformation&#34;&gt;Fourier Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An image can be expressed as sum of sine and cosine waves of varying&#xA;magnitude, frequency and phase. Fourier Transform is an operation which breaks down an image into its sine and cosine components, which is crucial for many image processing tasks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
